{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Robot Carnival","9 of Japan's leading animators were asked to create a short segment that followed the theme of \"Robots,\" for their inclusion in this film. Essentially, this \"movie\" is 9 short films, all independent of one another. The common element is human interaction with robots, namely the consequences of creating life with one's own hands, played in nine very different ways.\n\n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)\n\n\n\n1. Opening (dir. by Atsuko Fukushima and Katsuhiro Otomo)\n\n2. Franken's Gears (dir. by Koji Morimoto)\n\n3. Deprive (dir. by Hidetoshi Omori)\n\n4. Presence (dir. by Yasuomi Umetsu)\n\n5. Star Light Angel (dir. by Hiroyuki Kitazume)\n\n6. Cloud (dir. by Mao Lamdo)\n\n7. A Tale of Two Robots (dir. by Hiroyuki Kitakubo)\n\n8. Nightmare (dir. by Takashi Nakamura)\n\n9. Ending (dir. by Atsuko Fukushima and Katsuhiro Otomo)"],"ja":["ロボット・カーニバル",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-2182","ids":{"shikimori":2182,"mal":2182,"anilist":2182,"kodik":"serial-73182"},"kodikIds":["serial-73181","movie-68144","serial-73182"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-73181":"2026-01-31T13:06:19Z","movie-68144":"2021-02-18T16:09:30Z","serial-73182":"2026-01-31T13:44:21Z"},"title":"Карнавал роботов","originalTitle":"Robot Carnival","alt":"ロボットカーニバル / ロボット・カーニバル Robot Carnival ロボット・カーニバル","description":"Дамы и господа! Добро пожаловать на карнавал роботов — праздник смерти, радости, печали и любви, разрушений и новой жизни. Карнавал пронесёт вас через пространство и время, закружит в танце фантастической робототехники и покажет различные варианты событий, последующие за созданием жизни человеческими руками. Люди жаждут развлечений и опасаются собственных созданий, боясь увидеть в роботах отражение худших черт своих родителей. Металлические чудовища доктора Франкенштейна, храбрые железные защитники, деревянные роботы-гиганты и механические спутницы вмешиваются в быт человека-создателя и иллюстрируют наши страхи и мечты, заставляя задуматься о возможных последствиях. Полнометражный фильм включает в себя 9 коротких историй от разных авторов.","year":1987,"type":"OVA","genres":["Фэнтези","Фантастика","меха"],"rating":7.25,"popularity":11347,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/2182/da68a3972a7b12651ac284c2268b2350.jpeg","width":710,"height":1000},"backdrop":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2182-jaXWCFdBEi1V.jpg","width":1900,"height":400}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8,9],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-598","dubId":"598","label":"Сербин","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-73181","translationId":"598","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/1565321/6a316fa284da35f01260425a6baa818d/720p","season":1,"ordinal":1}},{"id":"kodik-869","dubId":"869","label":"Субтитры","language":"ja","original":true,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"movie-68144","translationId":"869","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/video/68144/61980f19af294deb7a5dac2f71acffe0/720p","season":1,"ordinal":1}},{"id":"kodik-609","dubId":"609","label":"AniDUB","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-73182","translationId":"609","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/1565330/8d75589f0698beda2be816577843b773/720p","season":1,"ordinal":1}}]},{"number":2,"ordinal":2,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-598","dubId":"598","label":"Сербин","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"prov